==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Tentacool|23}} from the {{TCG|Guardians Rising}} expansion.
*'''Rain Splash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Deoxys|Lotad|63}} from the {{TCG|EX Deoxys}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

